      <rules>
        <rule name="Quantum Deflection" id="3826-b9a6-fbd1-6f55" hidden="false" publicationId="026a-37f6-pubN68514">
          <description>If the Doomsday Ark from this Formation&apos;s quantum shielding is deactivated at the start of any of the controlling player&apos;s Movement phases, you can nominate an Annihilation Barge from this Formation within 6&quot; that has active quantum shielding. That Annihilation Barge&apos;s quantum shielding is immediately deactivated, and the Doomsday Ark&apos;s quantum shielding is immediately reactivated.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
    </selectionEntry>
