          <description>In its Shooting phase, in addition to using Powers of the C&apos;tan, this model can target one non-vehicle enemy unit within 12&quot; to which it has line of sight. The unit suffers a number of Wounds equal to 3D6 minus its Leadership, resolved at AP2 and with the Ignores Cover special rule. If at least one unsaved Wound is inflicted, the C&apos;tan Shard of the Nightbringer immediately regains one Wound lost earlier in the battle.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
