      <rules>
        <rule name="Command Wave" id="db71-0111-7824-d1c8" hidden="false" publicationId="026a-37f6-pubN68514">
          <description>All friendly units with the Necrons Faction within 12&quot; of a Catacomb Command Barge re-roll all failed Morale, Pinning and Fear tests. If your Warlord is a Catacomb Command Barge with the Immortal Hubris Warlord Trait, this special rule instead effects all friendly units with the Necrons faction within 18&quot; of your Warlord.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
